        "description": "Public: the login page needs this before anyone has a session.\n\nIt answers whether login is required at all and whether the development\ndefaults are still in force. Neither answer is a secret, and neither\nreveals a credential.",
        "operationId": "config_v1_auth_config_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AuthConfig"
